    <h2>What's in the Peppermint Bark Blizzard</h2>
  <p>Peppermint bark is a holiday confection made by layering dark chocolate and white chocolate with crushed peppermint candy on top. The DQ Peppermint Bark Blizzard blends pieces of this bark into vanilla soft serve — you get layers of chocolate flavor and a cool peppermint finish in every spoonful. It is one of the most anticipated seasonal Blizzards of the year. Find all current Blizzard flavors on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>
  <h2>Holiday Blizzard Season — Availability</h2>
  <p>The Peppermint Bark Blizzard is a winter seasonal flavor, typically available from November through early January. It is one of two major holiday-season Blizzards alongside the Frosted Sugar Cookie Blizzard. Once the holiday season ends, it will not return until the following winter.</p>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table">
