      <tr><td><strong><a href="/items/pumpkin-pie-blizzard">Pumpkin Pie</a></strong></td><td class="price-cell">$3.99</td><td>Fall (Sept–Nov)</td><td>Pumpkin spice + pie crust</td></tr>
